# DT
tags: heroes, benchmark
stimulus: Five rounds on one barbell; grip and shoulders, never put the bar down at the wrong moment.
5 rounds for time
  12 Deadlift 155/105 lb
  9 Hang power clean 155/105 lb
  6 Push jerk 155/105 lb

Scaled:
  Deadlift 105/75 lb
  Hang power clean 105/75 lb
  Push jerk 105/75 lb
